Plain English reviewed expansion, prepared 2026-09-09.

Contains selected and modified data from:
1. HuggingFaceTB/everyday-conversations-llama3.1-2k
   Revision: 14f543216b9ba42b6b951dc5bd199460d193b162
   https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceTB/everyday-conversations-llama3.1-2k
   Source creators: HuggingFaceTB; synthetic dialogues generated with
   Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct. Dataset card declares Apache-2.0.
2. OpenAssistant/oasst1, by the OpenAssistant community.
   Revision: fdf72ae0827c1cda404aff25b6603abec9e3399b
   https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenAssistant/oasst1
   Apache-2.0. Inherits 80 unchanged training dialogues from our earlier
   plain_english pilot, whose assistant answers were rewritten by Codex.

Changes to the everyday source: every source conversation reviewed by Codex;
unsuitable conversations excluded; selected assistant answers corrected or
simplified; greetings and pure closing acknowledgements removed; some dialogues
split into reviewed independent question/answer pairs. Original retained user
messages are preserved verbatim. Source answers are never supervised twice.
Source conversations, recorded narrow topics, and lexical near-question groups
are kept within one split. The source test partition is never used for training.

Review is AI editorial review with selective primary-source fact checks, not
human expert verification. Review records identify corrections and exclusions.
